From b4d354eff35b9727d3cee301260f08ed7d03ab3c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Raven Black <ravenblack@dropbox.com>
Date: Mon, 22 Jun 2026 14:58:16 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add BandwidthShare filter (#44275)

Commit Message: Add BandwidthShare filter
Additional Description: This is similar in concept and implementation to
`BandwidthLimit`, but resolving some usability issues of that filter for
certain purposes, briefly discussed in issue #42985. While that
discussion ended at "the behavior change should be tacked onto the
existing filter" the reviews of the resulting change demanded
significant API changes that made that approach unreasonable, hence, a
new filter.

Some relevant prerequisites of this PR (for anyone who wants to patch it
in) are #44012, #44145, #44171, #44145 and #44862, and (if running CI
tests) #44368 and #44864.
Risk Level: New filter, no risk to existing configs.
Testing: Yes, coverage >= default required.
Docs Changes: Added docs for the new filter.
Release Notes: Yes.
Platform Specific Features: n/a

---------

Signed-off-by: Raven Black <ravenblack@dropbox.com>
